# Kioskitos

Kioskitos monorepo.

## Structure
- `/frontend` – Next.js
- `/backend` – .NET Web API

## Workflow
- `main` is protected: direct commits are not allowed.
- Every change goes through a Pull Request with at least 1 approval.

## Branch naming
- `feat/<ticket>-<description>`  → e.g. `feat/KIOS-12-user-login`
- `fix/<ticket>-<description>`   → e.g. `fix/KIOS-30-cart-error`

Rules: lowercase, words separated by hyphens, no spaces.

## Environment variables
Never commit `.env` files. Use `.env.example` as a reference.